SUMMARY:Seniors in Spirit
DESCRIPTION:Seniors in Spirit monthly Luncheon is the 2nd Tuesday of each month\, 12:30 pm at Round Table at 2065 Occidental Rd\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401 \nWe meet in one of the large rooms off to the side of the ordering counter. \nFor Questions\, Contact person is Connie McMurray Nelin\n(707) 799-9366 \nWe look forward to seeing you there!
